div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.9900\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:98.0198%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 1.9802%); display:inline-block;\">99%&lt;?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:99.0099%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.9901%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:99.0099%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.9901%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond%20Arena\">Svargrond Arena</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Pit Lord attacks in melee range. The Pit Lord never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Pit Lord has no waves or beams, so you don't need to stand at a diagonal with him.<br/>Druid or Sorcerer: Throw 1-2 wall runes wall and run around them casting <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">Ice Strike</a> or using SD. It may be a good idea to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a> and/or <a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">Haste</a> in case he moves too fast.<br/>Knight: Melee and <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a>.<br/>Paladin: Use wall runes, shoot and cast <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Missile\">Divine Missile</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Giants\">Giants</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20King%20Chuck\">Angry King Chuck</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Cyclops\">Animated Cyclops</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Moohtant\">Animated Moohtant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Ogre%20Brute\">Animated Ogre Brute</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Ogre%20Savage\">Animated Ogre Savage</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animate